This Rust implementation follows the command-line behavior of the Greedy C++
software, created by Paul Yushkevich at the Penn Image Computing and Science
Lab and maintained by the Greedy open-source contributors. Project history and
source are available at https://sites.google.com/view/greedyreg/about and
https://github.com/pyushkevich/greedy. The upstream project is licensed under
the Apache License 2.0.

The browser build uses wasm-bindgen, wasm-bindgen-rayon and their generated
worker helper. Their notices and license terms remain in the generated source
and dependency distributions.
